  "tip": "<p>When you see large recurring object transfers across clouds, prefer the managed service with a built in <i>schedule</i>, automatic <i>retries</i>, and centralized monitoring. That usually indicates <i>Storage Transfer Service</i> over custom scripts or serverless functions.</p>",
